{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pizzapocalypse is a short game made in twelve weeks by second-year university students.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It feels like the world has forgotten about the joys of authentic, handmade pizza since the oppressive Pizza Corps moved into town with their &quot;cheap and efficient&quot; pizza-in-a-can... but one pizza chef is determined to deliver rich, traditional Italian cuisine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224960/extras/c731284ea2ddc34795cc8c746651946d.poster.avif?t=1768734220\" width=326 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224960/extras/c731284ea2ddc34795cc8c746651946d.webm?t=1768734220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224960/extras/c731284ea2ddc34795cc8c746651946d.mp4?t=1768734220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pizzapocalypse is a cartoony 3D platformer for all skill levels! As a chef, use your pizza to dash and bounce your way across rooftops, and fight robot minions as you traverse a corporation-ridden town to make a delivery to your loyal customers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time exploring every corner of the beautiful town, and collecting toppings to get the highest score possible!<i> Or</i> master your toolkit to get the fastest time, and attempt to complete bonus challenges. All play styles and skill levels can enjoy Pizzapocalypse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place in one level. Explore the three beautiful and distinct areas, each with multiple paths to uncover, and their own unique gameplay challenges and aesthetic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Made with love!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3224960/539f863c46ba1cc984f4f3506baeb5e91c403967.jpg"},{"name":"Keep the tip!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3224960/e35b336c74d4966f8f37565361cab3a9f2cce063.jpg"},{"name":"Every bit counts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3224960/394d12fb865d17b1c70a8f1870fe8b547a4ec74f.jpg"},{"name":"No time to waste!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3224960/00ea9dfbc68e77457a06eaa2c61f0a822b34b9e6.jpg"},{"name":"Can't touch this!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3224960/68b804cb62fa6c0c262218d44e86e79764c35921.jpg"},{"name":"Picky Eater","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3224960/dabeae90d326630e28b5e86714ac48fed91874da.jpg"},{"name":"Flat as a Pizza","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3224960/003815cac4cc816afc2c8bfe4983c22d9f8bf449.jpg"},{"name":"Clean Up The Streets","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3224960/1ebf361daf178325c6fcedf701e8f10d0ffcb4ad.jpg"},{"name":"Funny Rock Image Lover","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3224960/cbc27bdea9cc91c080a03eb929950fc4ea4b46af.jpg"},{"name":"The Floor is Lava","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3224960/718073fa1ed78e2be6e527d4e4e86eee6ec808b9.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3224960?t=1768734220","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224960/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768734220","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224960/e60ef7df1562489c0f671d10a04f2843349ce2a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768734220","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224960/e60ef7df1562489c0f671d10a04f2843349ce2a7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768734220","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Pizzapocalypse 2</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pizzapocalypse 2 is now available to be wishlisted on Steam!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce, swing, drive and slide through many new countries in this upcoming sequel- all in a colourful new art style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224960/extras/225a08ef65360e7099f92567ec6958e6.avif?t=1768734220\" width=1165 height=681 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pizzapocalypse is a short game made in twelve weeks by second-year university students.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It feels like the world has forgotten about the joys of authentic, handmade pizza since the oppressive Pizza Corps moved into town with their &quot;cheap and efficient&quot; pizza-in-a-can... but one pizza chef is determined to deliver rich, traditional Italian cuisine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224960/extras/c731284ea2ddc34795cc8c746651946d.poster.avif?t=1768734220\" width=326 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224960/extras/c731284ea2ddc34795cc8c746651946d.webm?t=1768734220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224960/extras/c731284ea2ddc34795cc8c746651946d.mp4?t=1768734220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pizzapocalypse is a cartoony 3D platformer for all skill levels! As a chef, use your pizza to dash and bounce your way across rooftops, and fight robot minions as you traverse a corporation-ridden town to make a delivery to your loyal customers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time exploring every corner of the beautiful town, and collecting toppings to get the highest score possible!<i> Or</i> master your toolkit to get the fastest time, and attempt to complete bonus challenges. All play styles and skill levels can enjoy Pizzapocalypse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place in one level. Explore the three beautiful and distinct areas, each with multiple paths to uncover, and their own unique gameplay challenges and aesthetic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Monkey Strike Games","Funny Rock Image"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224960/header.jpg?t=1768734220","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3224960/754879/e761946b9f324d47f6ddbd822b880a542478ee93/1750882519/dash_av1.mpd?t=1727203991","dash_h264":"http